      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This sounds somewhat similar to the issue I've experiencing. Old synched values are not being overwritten by the new owner, if the ownership transfer happened very recently.\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/vrchat-udon-closed-alpha-bugs/p/11694-networking-bug-serialization-fails-unexpected-when-object-is-disabled\nI first noticed this issue in build 11694.",
